              "y": 1064,
              "name": "ph",
              "fill": "#9e9e9e",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 660,
              "content": "Delivery\nBali only for now — and always free.\nCanggu, Ubud, Uluwatu or somewhere quieter down the coast: just tell us where you are, and we'll bring your ring to you, wrapped with care.\n\nPayment\nCard online, bank transfer, Wise or PayPal.\nNeed something else? Write to us — we'll find a way.",
              "fontFamily": "Belleza",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
