            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "BTu1n",
              "x": 873,
              "y": 5486,
              "name": "Payment  We keep payment simple — and flexible. You can pay by card transfer, cryptocurrency, Wise, or PayPal. Wherever you are in the world, there's a way that works for you. If none of these feel convenient, just write to us. We'll find an option that suits you — we always do.",
              "fill": "#fffdf4ff",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 819,
              "content": "Payment \nWe keep payment simple — and flexible.\nYou can pay by card transfer, cryptocurrency, Wise, or PayPal. Wherever you are in the world, there's a way that works for you.\nIf none of these feel convenient, just write to us. We'll find an option that suits you — we always do.",
              "fontFamily": "Belleza",
              "fontSize": 26,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qM6fN",
              "x": 35,
              "y": 5486,
              "name": "Delivery  Anywhere in Bali, delivery is on us — always free. Your piece is wrapped with care and sent on its way to you, whether you're in Canggu, Ubud, Uluwatu, or somewhere quieter down the coast. Just tell us where you are, and we'll bring it to you",
              "fill": "#fffdf4ff",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 818,
              "content": "Delivery \nAnywhere in Bali, delivery is on us — always free.\nYour piece is wrapped with care and sent on its way to you, whether you're in Canggu, Ubud, Uluwatu, or somewhere quieter down the coast. Just tell us where you are, and we'll bring it to you",
              "fontFamily": "Belleza",
              "fontSize": 30,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
